{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-velora","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"velora-2-emaar-properties-the-valley","about":"After the success of Velora 1, Emaar Properties has launched Velora 2. The project at The Valley Phase 2 by Emaar Properties offers 3 and 4-bedroom townhouses in a serene, nature-inspired setting. These homes combine modern design and spacious layouts, featuring large windows that create a seamless indoor-outdoor lifestyle. Velora 2 by Emaar offers a unique real estate investment opportunity with flexible payment plans. In The Valley, Velora 2 by Emaar Properties provides quick access to key areas like Expo 2020, Dubai South, and Jebel Ali.Residents enjoy The Valley Velora Phase 2 amenities, including pools, a fitness center, and nature-themed play areas. This thoughtfully designed master plan blends urban convenience with natural beauty, making Velora 2 in The Valley a perfect choice for families seeking comfort and style. With its strategic location, premium amenities, and elegant design, Velora Phase 2 townhouses offer tranquility and modern living.","price":2930000,"title":"Velora 2","bitrix":{"id":1001,"pf_id":"are.2.14317","source":null,"project_id":"Velora 2","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Velora","property_type":"Townhouses","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"The Valley"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/feature_64d63eacc6.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/feature_64d63eacc6.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0274393,"lng":55.4454063},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/g_8_2c76af0788.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/g_8_2c76af0788.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/g_11_1e96eae08b.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfr